    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Text: "We can no longer explain her disappearance.\r\n\nSince that night, the
    house has never been silent\u2014something remains.\r\nWe told everyone she ran
    away, but that wasn\u2019t the full truth.\r\n\nIf you found this, know we searched,
    and she didn\u2019t just leave.\r\nSomething took her, and we were powerless.\r\n\nThis
    key might help you escape.\r\nThe photo is the only proof we have.\r\n\nForgive
    us for failing to protect her."
